/*───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
             OLED MOD MENU CONTROLS
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  OPEN MENU
    Hold L2 / LT + Press OPTIONS / MENU
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  NAVIGATION (Menu Open)
    Scroll Up / Previous
      → D-Pad UP

    Scroll Down / Next
      → D-Pad DOWN

    Change Value / Toggle / Cycle
      → Increase / Next     → D-Pad RIGHT (tap or hold)
      → Decrease / Previous → D-Pad LEFT  (tap or hold)

    Select / Enter Submenu
      → CROSS / A

    Back / Previous Menu
      → CIRCLE / B
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  QUICK PROFILE SWITCHING (Menu Closed)
    Hold L2 / LT + D-Pad RIGHT
      → Cycle Recoil: Primary → Secondary → Ground Loot
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  VALUE ADJUSTMENT RULES
    Toggles (ON / OFF)
      → LEFT or RIGHT flips state

    Cycles (Layouts, Modes, etc.)
      → LEFT / RIGHT steps through options

    Numeric Values (Recoil, Delay, Drift, etc.)
      → RIGHT = +1 step
      → LEFT  = -1 step
      → Hold for rapid adjustment (~0.25s repeat)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  EXIT & SAVE
    Press CIRCLE / B repeatedly to fully exit back to game
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────*/
